  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:330px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-darkslateblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Fantastic-Matter Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/82/Absorbing_Man_Uru.png/revision/latest?cb=20220205104323\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Absorbing Man Uru\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/82/Absorbing_Man_Uru.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20220205104323\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/82/Absorbing_Man_Uru.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20220205104323 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/82/Absorbing_Man_Uru.png/revision/latest?cb=20220205104323 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Absorbing Man Uru\" width=\"270\" height=\"123\" data-image-key=\"Absorbing_Man_Uru.png\" data-image-name=\"Absorbing Man Uru.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Carl \"Crusher\" Creel/Absorbing Man (Marvel Comics) absorbs <b>Uru</b> by being struck with <b>Mjolnir</b>.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb fantastic-matter.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb fantastic-matter and utilize it in some way.</b> Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Manipulation\">Fantastic-Matter Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">Matter Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Known_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Phlebotinum/Unobtainium Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb fantastic-matter, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Capacitor\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Capacitor\">Fantastic-Matter Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Metabolization\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Metabolization\">Fantastic-Matter Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Enhanced\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Enhanced\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Supernatural\">Supernatural Condition</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Esoteric Element Absorption</b> - Absorption of a fantastic matter which has esoteric properties (divine, magic, spiritual, or sentient).</li>\n<li><b>Fantastic Alloy Absorption</b>  - Absorption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alloy\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Alloy\">metal alloy</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable. A fantastic-metal alloy is a mixture predominantly based on one or more metals, and it will include at least one fantastic or semi-fantastic element.</li>\n<li><b>Fantastic Compound Absorption</b>  - Absorption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chemical_compound\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Chemical compound\">chemical compound</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable. Molecules of a fantastic compound will include at least one fantastic or semi-fantastic element.</li>\n<li><b>Fantastic Element Absorption</b> - Absorption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chemical_element\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Chemical element\">chemical element</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.\n<ul><li><b>Fantastic-Metal Absorption</b> - Absorption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metal\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Metal\">metal element</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.</li>\n<li>Fantastic Non-Metal Absorption - Absorption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nonmetal\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Nonmetal\">Nonmetal element</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.</li>\n<li>Fantastic Metalloid Absorption - Absorption of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metalloid\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Metalloid\">Metalloid element</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.</li>\n<li>Semi-Fantastic element Absorption - Absorption of an extremely rare and valuable chemical element which does not have supernatural material properties itself, but which can be used to create compounds or alloys having such properties.</li></ul></li>\n<li><b>Fantastic Energy Absorption</b> - Absorption of an <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/energy\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:energy\">energy</a> which has supernatural material properties and is likely both extremely rare and valuable.</li>\n<li><b>Phlebotinum Absorption</b> - Absorption of a type of fantastic matter that exists because it was initially created through <a href=\"/wiki/Author_Authority\" title=\"Author Authority\">Author Authority</a> powers.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">Matter Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Manipulation\">Fantastic-Matter Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much fantastic-matter one can absorb</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li>Infected (<i>Arknights</i>)</li>\n<li>Osmosians (<i>Ben 10</i>)\n<ul><li>Kevin Levin</li></ul></li>\n<li>Mutants (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Scrin (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)\n<ul><li>Devourer Tanks</li>\n<li>Reaper Tripods</li>\n<li>Scrin Harvesters\n<ul><li>Shielded Harvesters</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Tiberium flora (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Tiberium wildlife (<i>Commans &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Doomguy/Doom Slayer (<i>Doom</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jakanddaxter.fandom.com/wiki/Jak\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jakanddaxter:Jak\">Jak</a> (<i>Jak and Daxter</i>)</li>\n<li>Jebidiah Christoff/Jebus/Jeb (<i>Madness Combat</i>)</li>\n<li>Mag Agent: Gestalt/Project Gestalt (<i>Madness Combat</i>)</li>\n<li>MPN Arena Mode Protagonist (<i>Madness Combat</i>); as the Offering</li>\n<li>Various characters (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)\n<ul><li>Carl \"Crusher\" Creel/Absorbing Man</li></ul></li>\n<li>Dark Samus (<i>Metroid</i>)</li>\n<li>Nora Valkyrie (<i>RWBY</i>)</li>\n<li>Bizarro (<i>Smallville</i>)</li>\n<li>Lana Lang (<i>Smallville</i>)</li>\n<li>Various characters (<i>Sonic the Hedgehog</i>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://sonic.fandom.com/wiki/Shadow_the_Hedgehog\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:sonic:Shadow the Hedgehog\">Shadow the Hedgehog</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Zerg (<i>StarCraft</i>)\n<ul><li>Extractors</li></ul></li>\n<li>Harvester Wheels (<i>Tempest Rising</i>)</li>\n<li>Veti (<i>Tempest Rising</i>); possible</li>\n<li>Cybertronians/Transformers (<i>Transformers</i>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Harvesters (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Heavy Harvesters (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Mammoth Armored Reclamation Vehicles (MARVs) (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Rocket Harvesters (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Praetor Suit (<i>Doom</i>)</li>\n<li>Spice Harvesters (<i>Dune</i>)</li>\n<li>Dissonance Cannons (<i>Madness Combat</i>)</li>\n<li>Dissonance Lancers (<i>Madness Combat</i>)</li>\n<li>Dissonance Scatterguns (<i>Madness Combat</i>)</li>\n<li>S-3LF Extractors (<i>Madness Combat</i>)</li>\n<li>SG10 Harvesters (<i>Tempest Rising</i>)</li>\n<li>Tempest Rigs (<i>Tempest Rising</i>)</li>\n<li>Tempest Spheres (<i>Tempest Rising</i>)</li>\n<li>Energon Harvesters (<i>Transformers Aligned continuity</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Locations\">Known Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFantastic-Matter_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D9&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bra